    "description": "Protect yourself against digital extortion, sextortion, and leaked images. Learn prevention strategies, legal remedies under Cybercrimes Acts, and support.",
    "kicker": "Digital Privacy and Security",
    "h1": "Blackmail and Leaked Photo Prevention for University Students: The Complete Guide",
    "lede": "Digital romance is an everyday reality of student life, but intimate image abuse and sextortion schemes pose devastating psychological and academic threats. Here is your definitive blueprint for safeguarding personal media, recognizing extortion tactics, and deploying statutory legal remedies against digital blackmailers.",
    "date": "2026-09-27",
    "ctaHeading": "Dating Grounded in Digital Integrity",
    "ctaText": "Experience high-security student dating with encrypted messaging, strict privacy protection, and zero tolerance for predatory behavior on The College Date.",
